EN:
Even if you can predict disaster,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
it is hard to avoid it{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
without the necessary knowledge{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.
However,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} if you wish to leave
things up to the heavens,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} that
too is a choice born of wisdom.
I pray you are able to find the best
path using your own power{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Farewell.

